('At the museum','explanation/interested.webp','Visitors watch a guide demonstrate a model.',['interested','interesting','confused'],['The visitors look interested because they are watching closely.','The demonstration seems interesting, but perhaps some parts are confusing.','I think it looks like a group learning how a machine works.'],'look up to'),
