('A round of applause','behind-the-picture/04-presentation.webp','One person holds notes while other people clap.',['relieved','proud','embarrassed'],['The speaker seems relieved because the presentation appears to be over.','I think the classmates look pleased with the presentation.','Perhaps the speaker feels embarrassed by all the attention.'],'be on cloud nine'),
