('Inside the gift','behind-the-picture/05-bag.webp','Two people look into a bag; its contents are hidden.',['excited','surprised','disappointed'],['They seem excited about what is inside the bag.','I think the gift looks surprising to them.','Perhaps one person is disappointed, but we need more information.'],'be on cloud nine'),
('Finding a piece','many-impressions/11-puzzle.webp','A group works on a wooden puzzle.',['confused','confusing','interested'],['The puzzle seems confusing because several pieces are still loose.','The group looks interested in solving it together.','I guess one person has found a solution while another is still thinking.'],'get along with'),
('A moment on the bench','many-impressions/12-support.webp','Two friends sit beside a sports bag; one offers water.',['disappointed','worried','grateful'],['One friend looks disappointed, but the reason is not clear.','The other person seems supportive because they are offering water.','Perhaps they are just resting after exercise rather than feeling sad.'],'cheer up'),
