('A quiet cup','many-impressions/14-cup.webp','A person holds a mug; tissues are on the table.',['tired','worried','relieved'],['He looks tired, and perhaps he is taking a break.','I guess he feels under the weather because there are tissues nearby.','He seems thoughtful. The tissues alone do not tell us how he feels.'],'feel under the weather'),
('Working on a project','many-impressions/15-project.webp','Two people share materials while building a model.',['interested','confident','confusing'],['They seem to get along with each other because they are sharing materials.','The project looks interesting, although some steps could be confusing.','I think one person looks confident while the other watches carefully.'],'get along with'),
('Learning a new skill','many-impressions/16-learning.webp','One person demonstrates a clay technique while another watches.',['interested','interesting','confident'],['The learner looks interested in the demonstration.','The person demonstrating seems patient and confident.','Perhaps the learner admires this person and wants to learn more.'],'look up to'),
